<header class="ref-head cen-head"><p class="cty-kicker">History by century · The 1600s</p><h1 class="research-title">The 17th century</h1><p class="ref-lede">In the 1600s, 1,367 recorded states existed somewhere in the world. 386 were founded and 215 came to an end. The great powers of the age included the Mughal Empire, the Ottoman Empire and the British Empire.</p></header>
